{
  "$comment": "Loss recovery, scripted: what RecoveryDriver::step (crates/core/punktfunk-core/src/client/recovery.rs) answers to each event. Core replays every case with the clock injected (`at_ms` from the case's start). A case marked `abi` holds embedder events only and nothing that depends on the clock: punktfunk-ffi and the Swift client replay it over a live connection, one C export per event (arrived = recovery_on_frame, decoded = recovery_on_decoded, no_output = recovery_on_no_output, lost = recovery_lost, reset = recovery_reset, need_keyframe = request_keyframe), and check what each call returns (admit and gap, hold and forgive_chain). `want` defaults: admit true, gap 0, hold false, forgive_chain false, ask \"none\"; `ask` is \"keyframe\", \"starved_keyframe\" (a freeze the client raised with nothing lost) or the RFI range [first, last]. `arrived` defaults: complete true, decode_order 0. `decoded` defaults: no flags, keyframe false, evidence \"unavailable\", sei false, recovery_point false, no decode_order. `noted` is note_frame_index, the lane that keeps no freeze. `tick` carries the drop count and `reset` answers nothing.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "a fast anchor is not refrozen by the same loss's drop climb",
      "steps": [
        {"at_ms": 0, "ev": "arrived", "index": 100, "want": {}},
        {"at_ms": 0, "ev": "arrived", "index": 102, "want": {"gap": 1, "hold": true, "ask": [101, 101]}},
        {"at_ms": 60, "ev": "decoded", "flags": ["anchor"], "want": {}},
        {"at_ms": 120, "ev": "tick", "frames_dropped": 1, "want": {}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "an anchor the decoder refutes holds until the original backstop",
      "steps": [
        {"at_ms": 0, "ev": "arrived", "index": 100, "want": {}},
        {"at_ms": 0, "ev": "arrived", "index": 102, "want": {"gap": 1, "hold": true, "ask": [101, 101]}},
        {"at_ms": 60, "ev": "decoded", "flags": ["anchor"], "evidence": "damaged", "want": {"hold": true}},
        {"at_ms": 120, "ev": "tick", "frames_dropped": 1, "want": {"hold": true}},
        {"at_ms": 499, "ev": "tick", "frames_dropped": 1, "want": {"hold": true}},
        {"at_ms": 500, "ev": "tick", "frames_dropped": 1, "want": {"hold": true, "ask": "keyframe"}}
      ]
    },
    {
